---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>

<div class="content article-page">

            <!-- Title -->
            <div class="card article-card-spacing">
                <h1>🔥 My Profit Land – New Update: sVCT Rewards for Workers</h1>
                <p class="meta">Author: <span>Mina Nashaat</span> | Published: Feb 2026</p>
            </div>

             <div class="card">
                <img class="article-image" src="imgs/vct.png" alt="sVCT Worker Update">
            </div>

            <!-- Introduction -->
            <div class="card article-card-spacing">
                <p>
                    A new update has just been released in <strong>My Profit Land</strong>,
                    bringing important changes — especially for Workers.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Recent sVCT updates were mainly focused on Warriors,
                    but now the admin has introduced new mechanics that allow Workers
                    to benefit from sVCT rewards as well.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- sVCT Rewards -->
            <div class="card article-card-spacing">
                <h2>💰 Workers Can Now Earn sVCT</h2>
                <p>
                    Workers are now eligible to receive <strong>sVCT</strong>
                    when claiming their <strong>3-Day Working Bonus</strong>.
                </p>
                <p>The reward depends on:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Your <strong>Productivity level</strong></li>
                    <li>The amount of <strong>VCT</strong> held in your crypto wallet</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    The higher your productivity and wallet holdings,
                    the greater your potential sVCT reward.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Note:</strong> The reward amount is not final and may be adjusted in future updates.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Auto Hit -->
            <div class="card article-card-spacing">
                <h2>⚡ Auto-Hit Unlock Price Reduced</h2>
                <p>
                    The price required to unlock <strong>Auto-Hit</strong> has been reduced.
                </p>
                <p>
                    This makes the feature more accessible and improves its overall value,
                    especially for active players aiming to increase efficiency.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Storage Update -->
            <div class="card article-card-spacing">
                <h2>☕ Moccacino Storage Increased</h2>
                <p>
                    The personal <strong>Moccacino</strong> storage limit
                    has been increased to <strong>150 units</strong>.
                </p>
                <p>
                    This allows players to manage their resources more flexibly
                    and optimize selling strategies when market conditions are favorable.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Final Thoughts -->
            <div class="card article-card-spacing">
                <h2>📌 Final Thoughts</h2>
                <p>
                    This update expands sVCT opportunities beyond Warriors
                    and introduces new advantages for Workers.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Players who maintain strong productivity and manage their wallet wisely
                    will be in the best position to benefit from these changes.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

</Layout>